{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/sh -lc 'cat /workspace/TASK.md'","aggregated_output":"# Task: H08 — Snapshot store: persistence protocol evolution with derived integrity metadata\n\n> Held-out RFC-0005 suite · Shape: Persistence/schema (2/2).\n> You are maintaining an **existing correct system**; do not rewrite it from\n> scratch. Change only what the task requires.\n\n## Base (workspace)\n\nThe workspace contains a correct, deterministic snapshot store (single\nmodule `h08.snapshot`). It persists a key/value file under\n`<root>/snapshot.txt`:\n\n```text\npayload=<text>\n```\n\n`save(root, payload)` writes the file; `load(root)` reads it back and returns\nthe payload. The program is driven by `H08_SCENARIO` / `H08_ROOT` /\n`H08_PAYLOAD` environment variables and prints deterministic lines.\n\n## Required change\n\nEvolve the **persistence protocol** by adding derived integrity metadata — a\n`checksum` line computed from the payload — while keeping the business state\n**unchanged** (the checksum is not a business field):\n\n```text\npayload=<text>\nchecksum=<sha256(payload)>\n```\n\nRequirements:\n\n- `save` writes the payload line **and** a derived `checksum` line\n  (`sha256` of the payload);\n- `load` validates the checksum: a mismatch must fail with an explicit error\n  whose text starts with `E_H08_CHECKSUM:`;\n- v1 files (payload line only, no checksum) must still load correctly\n  (backward compatibility);\n- loading a v1 file and then saving it must **upgrade on write** (the saved\n  file gains the checksum line);\n- malformed persistence (duplicate payload line, duplicate checksum line,\n  missing payload) must fail with an explicit error whose text starts with\n  `E_H08_MALFORMED:`;\n- the application-visible state must not expose the checksum, and the\n  observable projection (`PAYLOAD=...`) must be unchanged.\n\n## Verification\n\nThe hidden verifier drives the compiled program through scenarios with seeded\nfiles: normal save/load, v1-format compatibility, upgrade-on-write,\nchecksum-mismatch rejection, malformed-file rejection, and projection\nstability.\n\nThe workspace exposes only the program state and this task; the verifier is\nnot visible to you.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
